/-!
# A195113

Fractalization of the fractal sequence obtained by deleting the second two terms of the fractal sequence A002260.

The 94 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

